dited mid-scan, persistent [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]contention still alerts, and a refs full scan re-plans only the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]PDFs an edit actually affects.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]tick_contention_noise.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/tick_contention_noise.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-pj[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-pj/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Report vault contention as waiting, with escalation[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tick-contention-waits[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tick-contention-waits: give bob ref scan an inputs_changed error code, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]map lock_busy/scan_busy/inputs_changed child failures to tick waits, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]escalate persistent contention to a stalled failure, keep derive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]follow-ups, and update docs and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Invalidate only the plans an edit affects[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]refs-incremental-coherence[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tick-contention-waits[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]refs-incremental-coherence: classify scan snapshot mismatches by owner, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-plan only affected PDFs then re-run finalization in a bounded refresh[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]at all three stale sites, keep global and fail-closed paths, and extend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the interleave tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-pj","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-pj.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fcf92da545ddf13240ea85ea5679dc74","started_at":"2026-11-22T23:03:27.729675+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-pj","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-pj.1","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-pj.2","bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-pj.land"]}
